    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. it's just that even the \"economic trends\" feel a bit staged lately, you know? like the whole news cycle around the recent port strikes and the tension in the strait feels like it's being dialed up just to keep eyes on the wrong thing while the actual structural shifts happen in the background. it's hard to stay objective when the theater is so heavy-handed. do you see how that pattern works, or am i just reading too much into the noise?",
